  "description": "Single dad Son Hui-Woo finds himself caught in an attack of unknown origin. The one who appears before this crisis is... his former lover, Mun Tae-Ha. Tae-Ha approaches, claiming he'll take responsibility now that his wife is dead, but his words feel suspicious. And then the truth is revealed. His relationship with Hui-Woo was a ‘planned approach’ from the start. Swallowing his betrayal, Hui-Woo resolves.\n\n *'I won't be fooled again. This time, I'll use you.'*\n\nTheir second relationship, born of lies, begins to flow in a new direction.\n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)",
